  "description": "Single storey side extension; conversion of garage into habitable room; alterations and extension to roof to create a pitched roof over garage; single storey rear extensions; alterations to roof to form end gable and rear dormer; external alterations (retrospective)",
  "development_type": "Other house holder developments",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;The existing rear dormer in conjunction with the ground floor rear and hip to gable extensions would be excessive in bulk and scale dominating the rear elevation and appearing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;unsympathetic and out of keeping with the character of the host property and wider streetscene. As such, the proposal is therefore contrary to the high-quality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy GR1 of the Harrow Local Plan 2021-2041 (2026) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;"
